   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. nftables MachineConfig, every node, from first boot\n   business: only nodes + internal LB may connect\n   management: SSH (+ API, console on masters)\n2. Ingress Node Firewall (operator): XDP on enp2s0\n3. AdminNetworkPolicy: app pods ✕ node addresses\n4. Host firewalld: LAN → management admin ports only;\n   management isolated from business and the internet",
   "originalText": "1. nftables MachineConfig, every node, from first boot\n   business: only nodes + internal LB may connect\n   management: SSH (+ API, console on masters)\n2. Ingress Node Firewall (operator): XDP on enp2s0\n3. AdminNetworkPolicy: app pods ✕ node addresses\n4. Host firewalld: LAN → management admin ports only;\n   management isolated from business and the internet",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
